  "description": "What PhysicsOccluder needs of a physics world: an AABB query over its live colliders. Structural on purpose. `@codexo/exojs-physics` satisfies it as it stands, and this package does not depend on it, so a project without physics pulls none of it in and a project with a collision layer of its own can still feed shadows from it.",
